    "reviews": "\u201cBattlesector brings the new era of the 40K tabletop game to the PC like a thunder hammer to the head of a hive tyrant.\u201d<br>8/10 \u2013 IGN USA<br><br>\u201cIt is a fun, brutal, and faithful adaptation of the original Warhammer 40,000 tabletop, worthy of any Warhammer 40,000 fan or strategy fan's purchase\u201d<br>4/5 \u2013 Windows Central<br><br>\u201cBattlesector really is a cut above\u201d<br>PC Gamer<br>",
